  "boundaries": [
    "Runtime scope is retained OMP children. Direct turn, Codex exec, Claude and Muse native replies remain unsupported.",
    "OMP root without a registered parent retains the raw frame and records an observation error that makes receive fail after native exit. A native waiting for an unanswered UI request may remain waiting until explicitly stopped.",
